      "key": "DORA-8087",
      "summary": "Configuring Infinite Kitchen menu items and ingredients",
      "url": "https://wonder.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/788842",
      "browse_url": "https://wonder.atlassian.net/browse/DORA-8087",
      "description": "Ingredients and menu items need to be configured with the necessary data in cookbook to communicate ingredient eligibility to the Infinite Kitchen. Ideally, are configured by the week of 7/20 to allow time for testing and refinement befoe the Midtown Eats launch in early August\nConnect with \n@Jennifer West\n, @charlie Fox, and \n@Casey Lee\n with any questions\nDetails on how to configure the ingredients and linebuilds can be found here: \nhttps://wonder.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020a23d399f56f34b208584dc6e78d90758/pages/5395382324/Configuring+Cookbook+Data+for+Infinite+Kitchen\n \nConfiguration requires understanding which ingredients will be dispensed from the Infinite Kitchen versus which will be added by hand at the finishing station. Master data is owned by \n@Jennifer West\n and can be found here: \nhttps://foodtruckinc-my.sharepoint.com/:x:/g/personal/jennifer_wonder_com/IQDamXozDTo0TJgJJ-zI_zOiAf1ieVKZ26tA0QhNUEQMTYI?e=Jzs4eX\n \nVerify which menu item variants will be applicable at Midtown East in August, e.g.\nQuesadilla (BYO), Limesalt (8005007)\nQuesadilla (BYO), Limesalt (Jasmine Rice Pilot) (8011570)\nQuesadilla (BYO), Limesalt (Cook & Chill Rice Pilot) (8011834)\nAt a high level, the following items need to be configured \nRoyal Greens\nBYO Salad\nYasas\nBYO Bowl\nBYO Sandwich\nPop Salad\nBYO Salad\nEl Diez\nBYO bowl\nSide of corn salsa\nSide of pico de gallo\nLimesalt\nBYO Bowl\nBYO Tacos\nBYO Burrito\nBYO Quesadilla\nBYO Salad\nSide of corn salsa\nSide of pico de gallo\nHanu Poke\nBYO Poke bowl\nBYO Spicy Poke Bowl\nSide of poke rice",
